# Container and Presentation Pattern

- Use containers for data access, state orchestration, mutations, and side effects.
- Keep presentation components focused on rendering props and emitting typed user events.
- Presentation components must not call APIs or import feature stores directly.
- Prefer colocating each container with its presentation component and feature-specific types.
- Do not split trivial components when the separation adds indirection without a meaningful behavior/UI boundary.
